|-----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------|---------------|--------------|
| **G1**         | Execute Resource Delivery Mission                                                             | -                  | Perform       | N/A          |
| **G2**         | Execute Collection Phase                                                                      | ;                  | Perform       | AND          |
| **G3**         | Execute Delivery Phase                                                                        | -                  | Perform       | AND          |
| **G2.1**       | Navigate to Storage Place                                                                     | -                  | Perform       | AND          |
| **G2.2**       | Request Resources from Storage                                                                | -                  | Perform       | AND          |
| **G2.3**       | Wait for Resource Retrieval                                                                   | -                  | Achieve      | AND          |
